  "description": "Built for riders who see every street as a playground, the Legion is the ultimate urban weapon for wheelies, combos, and all-day sessions. Its purpose-built 6061-T6 aluminium frame features dedicated wheelie geometry, making it quick to lift, easy to control, and stable when the speed picks up. Lightweight yet incredibly durable, the Legion is ready to take whatever the streets throw your way.\nWith fully sealed Radio PRO wheels, grippy 2.2\" Radio tyres, and powerful Tektro disc brakes front and rear, this is a bike designed to push progression and keep the good times rolling. Unlike anything else on the market, the Legion is built to stand out.\nNow the real decision: 26\" or 29\"?",
